1
00:00:00,989 --> 00:00:02,029
(Howard:)I mean, for free.

2
00:00:04,451 --> 00:00:08,291
(Raj:)And plus you got a rapid prototyper.
That's an expensive piece of equipment.

3
00:00:08,455 --> 00:00:10,995
(Leonard:)The rest of us have had our budgets
cut to the bone.

4
00:00:11,458 --> 00:00:15,498
(Howard:)Okay, one way to look at this is that
I'm getting new equipment and you're not...

5
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:17,300
(Howard:)...and that's unfair.

6
00:00:17,464 --> 00:00:21,094
(Howard:)But a better way to look at this
is that I'm getting sex and you're not.

7
00:00:21,259 --> 00:00:22,969
(Howard:)And that's delightful.

8
00:00:25,764 --> 00:00:28,014
(Penny:)The whole thing froze.
I don't know what happened.

9
00:00:28,183 --> 00:00:29,473
(Leonard:)Calm down. We'll figure it out.

10
00:00:29,642 --> 00:00:32,142
(Penny:)How can I calm down?
I'm gonna lose my shopping cart.

11
00:00:32,312 --> 00:00:36,192
(Penny:)That's three hours of picking out shoes
just shot to hell.

12
00:00:36,649 --> 00:00:38,359
- Hello, Penny.
- Hello, Sheldon.

13
00:00:38,526 --> 00:00:40,486
(Sheldon:)You're in my spot.

14
00:00:41,279 --> 00:00:44,989
- Are you planning on sitting here?
- No, I'm going to the comic-book store.

15
00:00:45,158 --> 00:00:47,748
(Penny:)- What difference does it make?
- What difference?

16
00:00:47,911 --> 00:00:49,541
(Leonard:)Here we go.

17
00:00:49,704 --> 00:00:51,164
(Sheldon:)That is my spot.

18
00:00:51,331 --> 00:00:54,871
(Sheldon:)In an ever-changing world,
it is a single point of consistency.

19
00:00:55,043 --> 00:00:57,673
(Sheldon:)If my life were expressed as a function...

20
00:00:57,837 --> 00:01:00,377
(Sheldon:)...on a four-dimensional
Cartesian coordinate system...

